//> 2 processors, 8 GB of memory, up 1 hours
//> The processors are 0% busy; memory in use: 621 MB
//> Waiting for a processor, on average: 0.28 in the last minute, 1.02 in the last fifteen
//> A disk at /: 31 GB free of 270
//> 9 programs are running; the biggest is claude at 404 MB
//> This program is number 13480 started by 13479
//> Watching a folder:
//>   cabby-notes/shopping.txt was created
//>   cabby-notes/shopping.txt is now cabby-notes/list.txt
//>   cabby-notes/list.txt was deleted
//>   caught user1
